{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And he encountered the place.</b> An expression of prayer, and this is the evening prayer, before the sun had set — for it is written ויפגע במקום and afterwards כי בא השמש. However, according to the position in Berakhot, it implies that the time for the evening Shema does not arrive until the stars emerge."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:12.615508687Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}